PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: States
    - Three states: q0, q1, q2
    - Circles: 120px diameter, 4px stroke
    - Accepting state q2: double circle
  L2: Transitions
    - Arrows between states
    - Labels: "a", "b"
    - Deterministic: one outgoing arrow per symbol
  L3: Start Arrow
    - Arrow entering q0 from left
  L4: Labels
    - "q0", "q1", "q2"
    - "DFA: (Q, Σ, δ, q0, F)"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
